233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Our findings point to four actions. Each one answers something the data showed us, each one can be started with the information the company already has, and each one can be measured again in the same dashboard.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (The chart on the left is where we would watch the effect: every bubble is a product family, with its average delay, its average review and the money it brings. If the actions work, the bubbles move to the left and up. We would review that picture every quarter, with the same filters we used today, so the discussion stays on the same numbers.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
