/P 468 0 R
/E (Promise with data: Build the estimated date from the real route between seller and customer.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
236 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 469 0 R
/E (Move stock closer to the north and the north east, so the longest routes become short ones.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
